   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bon → meilleur",
     "texto": [
      "**Bon** (good) changes to **meilleur** (better). As an adjective, it agrees: **un meilleur café**, **une meilleure idée**, **de meilleurs cafés**.",
      "You don't say **plus bon**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Bien → mieux",
     "texto": [
      "**Bien** (well) is an adverb and changes to **mieux** (better): **Tu parles mieux français que moi**. **Meilleur** is an adjective that agrees with the noun; **mieux** usually modifies a verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
